      ],
      "rationale": "The AIP-AHR branch now has a supported immediate outcome: altered AHR target-gene transcription and altered kynurenine-dependent GH secretion in GH3 cells. What remains unresolved is whether that branch is a causal driver of the human macroadenoma growth and invasiveness phenotype, rather than a measurable molecular/endocrine readout of AIP loss.",
